{
  "about": "The value each tool's page sends to its route to mean the first and the second page of a PDF. src/test/page-contract.test.tsx checks that the pages send these values; backend/tests/test_page_contract.py sends them through the real routes and checks that the change lands on that page and nowhere else. A page and a route that count pages differently fail one of the two.",
